  "limitations": [
    "The scenario covers production Console onboarding, exact replay, context changes, auth refusal and selected durable counts. Wallet activation, relocation, tenant-root retirement and authorized restore remain separate gates.",
    "The test uses a single SEV-SNP VM and isolated GCS prefix. It does not establish attestation-controlled key release.",
    "The read-only proof client uses the existing native D1 CLI through SSH. Its boundary selects exactly one numeric count row and removes successful CLI progress text. The application SQL and Worker handlers remain unchanged.",
